{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>大埔發生火警。今日（28日）傍晚5時56分，警方接獲報案，指大埔頭水圍村一間村屋起火。消防趕至，動用一條喉及一隊煙帽隊灌救，約23分鐘後將火撲熄。據了解，火警中無人受傷，毋須疏散，初步疑煙頭點燃家具釀禍。</p><p>讀者提供影片拍攝到事發時，涉事村屋的上層陷火海，內部火光熊熊，大量濃煙由窗戶竄出。現場可見，消防員事後進入村屋調查；窗框附近的牆身被熏黑。</p><figure><img alt=\"大埔頭水圍村有村屋起火，上層竄出濃煙。（Threads@dengjunrong）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261128/1203422273097175040860512.jpeg/jBjzL2Z5p7y0DbHgJ93AvXx5Sn65-1K6z2R46c9keOk\"/><figcaption>大埔頭水圍村有村屋起火，上層竄出濃煙。（Threads@dengjunrong）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"大埔頭水圍村有村屋起火，上層竄出濃煙。（Threads@dengjunrong）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261128/1203422388847382528062874.jpeg/8yWaxLJwTgn-nr9-CZ3mQuFWlaosEbj6BQAsKwUALCs\"/><figcaption>大埔頭水圍村有村屋起火，上層竄出濃煙。（Threads@dengjunrong）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-28T11:38:07.504496+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":254,"images":2,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-28T11:01:50+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T11:31:38.959937+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-28T11:31:38.959937+00:00","content_hash":"fada3020cf452ee56d5d7adf1b349920f9d558863a039e7215b0edad18ed954f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}